   "domain": 1,
   "task": "1.1",
   "stem": "A radiology startup hosts a computer vision model on Amazon SageMaker AI. Each request uploads a scan of up to 800 MB, and the model takes up to 10 minutes to produce a result. Requests arrive in unpredictable bursts, and the company doesn't want to pay for idle instances overnight. Which deployment option should it use?",
