   "domain": 1,
   "task": "1.2",
   "stem": "An online retailer has purchase histories for 3 million customers but no predefined customer categories. The marketing team wants to discover natural groups of customers with similar buying behavior so it can design a campaign for each group. Which technique should the team use?",
