   "domain": 1,
   "task": "1.3",
   "stem": "A retailer's demand-forecasting model was accurate at launch, but six months later its predictions are getting worse because shopping patterns changed. The ML team wants to detect this automatically and retrain the model with recent data without manual steps. Which approach reflects MLOps best practice?",
