   "id": "5-20",
   "domain": 5,
   "task": "5.1",
   "stem": "A company runs its model-serving containers on Amazon ECS and its pre-processing code on AWS Lambda. It wants continuous scanning of these workloads for known software vulnerabilities. Which AWS service should it use?",
